# CogSynDelta -- memory

`{{ region_cfg.get("licence_tier") or "licence: see below" }}` · code revision `{{ code_revision }}` · metrics schema `{{ metrics_schema }}`

One faculty region of the composed CogSynDelta mind -- the region MERGE of `compress`
and `retrieve` (per `docs/design/LICENCE-FOR-OPEN-WEIGHTS.md`, Rider 1: a merge
inherits its most restrictive parent licence). An encoder that maps text input to the
shared latent stream, **not a chat model and not usable on its own for open-ended
generation**.

